From fd9efe4cf64487380b7426008f6023480b9ee103 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tyler South <tsouth2@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 00:35:08 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Rebuild aquamarine 0.16.0 with the cursor hotspot patch

Arch moved aquamarine to 0.16.0, which replaces the patched 0.15.1-1.1 on update and drops the hotspot patch. Re-pin the 0.16.0 source as 0.16.0-1.1 (SONAME 15), raise the runtime package to 4.0.4-13 so it requires the rebuild, and deliver it with compatibility revision 67.
